Kinaigraph is pre-release (alpha/beta) software. This repository contains three
kinds of material, each covered by its own terms below. A single "No Warranty"
clause at the end applies to all of them.

  1. Binaries      — the Kinaigraph executables and other compiled artifacts.
  2. Examples      — the contents of the examples/ directory.
  3. Documentation — all other written material (guides, references, READMEs).

