the Kinaigraph binaries for any purpose, commercial purposes included, until
the release's expiration date. Every release carries the date on which it stops
rendering (`kinaigraph doctor` shows it). On that date the right to run that
release ends; a newer release carries its own date and its own terms.

YOUR INPUT AND YOUR OUTPUT ARE YOURS. The documents, artwork, scripts and
recordings you author (the input) and the videos and other files Kinaigraph
produces from them (the output) belong to you. This license claims no rights in
either, and you may use, publish, sell and license them as you see fit.

The binaries themselves remain the property of the copyright holder. You may
redistribute them only in their original, unmodified form and free of charge.
You may NOT modify, adapt, decompile, disassemble, reverse-engineer, or create
derivative works of the binaries.

The binaries are pre-release software provided on an "AS IS" basis. No guarantee
is made as to whether or how they work, and no support of any kind is provided.
Use them at your own risk.

