2. Examples
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The example projects in the examples/ directory may be copied, modified, and
used for non-commercial purposes only, with attribution. You may NOT use them
for commercial purposes. "Commercial purposes" means any use primarily intended
for or directed toward commercial advantage or monetary compensation. This
restriction is about the example material itself; what you make with Kinaigraph
from your own material is covered by the Binaries section above and is yours.

THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL. Some examples quote or refer to material owned by others.
That material is NOT covered by the grant above and is not the copyright holder's
to license. It remains the property of its owner and is included here for
commentary and illustration; your right to reuse it is a question between you and
its owner. Each such example names its source in its README. As of this writing:

  examples/agent-patterns/  quotes three sentences from "Building effective
                            agents" (Anthropic, Erik S. and Barry Zhang,
                            19 December 2024) and uses that article's pattern
                            names. The diagrams are redrawn, not reproduced.
                            Not affiliated with, or endorsed by, Anthropic.

